## Problem
B277 caps `/ws/subscribe` Expert upgrades (global + per-IP). The older `/observer/<binding>` WS path still upgrades with no process-wide or per-IP concurrent-session limit (dup fd + async loop in relay.ml). A flood of observer handshakes can still hold unbounded long-lived connections.

## Solution
Reuse or mirror `Relay_ws_server.ConnectionCap` (or a sibling ObserverCap) for observer sessions: acquire before upgrade, free on `ObserverSessions.remove`, reject with 503 + Retry-After. Surface count in heartbeat/stats if cheap.

## Files
- ocaml/relay.ml (observer upgrade ~6820)
- tests

